{%- comment -%}
  Renders the globe glyph used on the brand values strip.

  Drawn to the Phase 2 contract - 24x24 canvas, stroke 1.5,
  currentColor, round caps and joins. Traced from the prototype's own raster
  at brand-assets/images/icon-globe.png, which PHASE-2:1417 lists as one of
  the four value glyphs the prototype supplied as PNG. Raster cannot follow
  currentColor, a hover or a surface, which is why it is redrawn here.

  Accepts:
  - class: {String} optional extra class names

  Usage:
  {% render 'icon-globe', class: 'icon--xl' %}

  Decorative: the tile's title and subtitle carry the meaning, so the mark is
  aria-hidden and the tile needs no alternative text.
{%- endcomment -%}
<svg class="icon icon--globe {{ class }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 3v18"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M4.2 7.5h15.6"/><path d="M4.2 16.5h15.6"/><path d="M12 3a5 9 0 0 1 0 18"/><path d="M12 3a5 9 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg>
